msgid "Internal perimeters"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4749
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for internal perimeters. You may "
"want to use thinner extrudates to get more accurate surfaces. If left zero, default extrusion "
"width will be used if set, otherwise 1.125 x nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as "
"percentage (for example 200%) it will be computed over the selected calculation base."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4763
msgid ""
"Base for percentage-based perimeter extrusion width calculation. Used only for percentage values."
msgstr ""

