msgid "Steeper ramp before obstacles"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5031
msgid ""
"If enabled, ApiumSlicer detects obstacles along the travel path and makes the slope steeper in "
"case an obstacle might be hit during the initial phase of the travel."
msgstr ""

