msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5943
msgid "Filter small internal bridges"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5945
msgid ""
"Controls filtering of small internal bridge areas. Limited and no filtering create more internal "
"bridge support below top surfaces."
