msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7275
msgid "Pillar diameter"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7277
msgid "Diameter in mm of the support pillars"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7285
msgid "Small pillar diameter percent"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7287
msgid ""
"The percentage of smaller pillars compared to the normal pillar diameter which are used in "
"problematic areas where a normal pilla cannot fit."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7296
msgid "Max bridges on a pillar"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7298
msgid ""
"Maximum number of bridges that can be placed on a pillar. Bridges hold support point pinheads and "
"connect to pillars as small branches."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7306
msgid "Max weight on model"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7309
msgid ""
"Maximum weight of sub-trees that terminate on the model instead of the print bed. The weight is "
"the sum of the lenghts of all branches emanating from the endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7317
msgid "Pillar connection mode"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7318
msgid ""
"Controls the bridge type between two neighboring pillars. Can be zig-zag, cross (double zig-zag) "
"or dynamic which will automatically switch between the first two depending on the distance of the "
"two pillars."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7324
msgid "Zig-Zag"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7324
msgid "Cross"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7324
msgid "Dynamic"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7336
msgid "Pillar widening factor"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7340
msgid ""
"Merging bridges or pillars into another pillars can increase the radius. Zero means no increase, "
"one means full increase. The exact amount of increase is unspecified and can change in the future."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7351
msgid "Support base diameter"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7353
msgid "Diameter in mm of the pillar base"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7361
msgid "Support base height"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7363
msgid "The height of the pillar base cone"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7370
msgid "Support base safety distance"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7373
msgid ""
"The minimum distance of the pillar base from the model in mm. Makes sense in zero elevation mode "
"where a gap according to this parameter is inserted between the model and the pad."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7383
msgid "Critical angle"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7385
msgid "The default angle for connecting support sticks and junctions."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7393
msgid "Max bridge length"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7395
msgid "The max length of a bridge"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7407
msgid "Max pillar linking distance"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7409
msgid ""
"The max distance of two pillars to get linked with each other. A zero value will prohibit pillar "
"cascading."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7417 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:9925
msgid "Object elevation"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:7419
msgid ""
"How much the supports should lift up the supported object. If \"Pad around object\" is enabled, "
"this value is ignored."
msgstr ""

